Feature: Multiple Target for AOT Promotion



    #AOT

    Scenario: Verify admin user can create AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion with valid start and end date

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion with outside the promotion period

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion within the promotion period

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion can run until the promotion period

    Scenario: Verify the metric can be configured for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the AOT promotion where the metric are configured before the promotion end date and the metric are not picked after the metric end date

    Scenario: Verify the AOT promotion where the metric are not able to configure after the promotion end date

    #Target

    Scenario: Verify the multiple levels of target can be configured for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the multiple target can be assigned to the set of audience in AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the multiple target level can be based quantity for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the multiple target level can be based on the value for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the target level can be configured in AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the maximum target level can be configured for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the target as quantity and participant can able to claim the achieved promotion

    Scenario: Verify the target as value and participant can able to claim the achieved promotion

    Scenario: Verify the participant can able to claim any level when the achieved target is matched to it

    Scenario: Verify the participant can able to claim any level when the achieved quantity is matched to it



    #Audience

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion with static audience and verify the audience user comes under the promotion

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion with dynamic audience and verify the audience user comes under the promotion

    Scenario: Exclude a particular user from the audience and verify the user is not eligible for the AOT promotion

    Scenario: Exclude an organization from the AOT promotion and verify the user is not eligible forthe AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the audience list is updated and the participant user is removed form the audience list for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the audience list is updated and the participant user is added to the audience list for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify AOT promotion where the participant user is already a part of promotion and the user is excluded form the audience list

    Scenario: Verify the non activated participant user is added to the audience list and the user is activated after the promotion is started for AOT promotion

    Scenario: Verify the dynamic audience in the AOT promotion where the new user is added with the jobrole that is a part of the audience list

    Scenario: Verify the dynamic audience in the AOT promotion where the user jobrole changes

    Scenario: Verify the scenario where the same participant user is added in both eligible audience and reporting audience for AOT promotion





